{"book":"obadiah","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:02:08.286590872Z","verse":12,"ref":"obadiah 1:12","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":1,"translation":"But do not look on in the day of your brother, in the day of his calamity, and do not rejoice over the children of Yehudah in the day of their destruction, and do not make your mouth great in the day of distress.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"and do not"},{"surface":"תרא","gloss":"look"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"אחיך","gloss":"of your brother"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"נכרו","gloss":"of his calamity"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"and do not"},{"surface":"תשמח","gloss":"rejoice"},{"surface":"לבני","gloss":"over the children"},{"surface":"יהודה","gloss":"Judah"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"אבדם","gloss":"of their destruction"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"and do not"},{"surface":"תגדל","gloss":"make great"},{"surface":"פיך","gloss":"your mouth"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"צרה","gloss":"of distress"}]}